1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,455
这条命令来自这节课的 README
A command from this lecture's README,

2
00:00:02,455 --> 00:00:05,109
在一台从没构建过这个 image 的笔记本上运行
on a laptop that never built this image:

3
00:00:05,109 --> 00:00:08,427
本地没有 image，它就从 Docker Hub pull 一个下来
with no local image, it pulls one from Docker Hub.

4
00:00:08,747 --> 00:00:14,997
在里面，Python 显示的是 3.8.17，而 Gemini 的库导入不了
Inside, Python says 3.8.17, and the Gemini library won't import.

5
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:19,030
可这个 repo 的 Dockerfile 写的是 Python 3.14
Yet this repo's Dockerfile says Python 3.14.

6
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:24,684
这个 image 是 2025 年 2 月构建的，用的是 Python 3.8
This image was built in February 2025, with Python 3.8.

7
00:00:25,004 --> 00:00:26,417
它是从哪儿来的？
Where did it come from?

8
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:32,398
第二个意外来自另一个教程：一个在 port 9200 上监听的服务器
A second surprise, from the other tutorial: a server listening on port 9200.

9
00:00:32,718 --> 00:00:34,673
笔记本连不上它
The laptop can't reach it;

10
00:00:34,673 --> 00:00:38,584
另一个 container 按名字去问，却得到了回复：ok
another container, asking by name, gets a reply: ok.

11
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,127
两个谜题
Two puzzles.

12
00:00:40,177 --> 00:00:44,145
第一部分：那个 image 是从哪儿来的，你该自己构建还是 pull？
Part 1: where did that image come from, and should you build or pull?

13
00:00:44,465 --> 00:00:46,620
第二部分：这是谁的 localhost？
Part 2: whose localhost is it?

14
00:00:46,867 --> 00:00:51,390
进度条显示 README 的步骤，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker shows the README step, code panels show file and line numbers.

15
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:53,968
看到黄色的 your turn 标签就暂停
Pause at the yellow your-turn tag;

16
00:00:53,968 --> 00:00:57,555
灰色的 extra 标签表示 README 里没有的命令
gray extra tags mark commands the README doesn't have.

17
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:00,339
每条命令也都在学习指南里
Every command is also in the study guide.

18
00:01:00,659 --> 00:01:02,558
第一部分需要 Tutorial 0
Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.

19
00:01:02,558 --> 00:01:05,569
以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.

20
00:01:05,569 --> 00:01:07,293
第二部分只需要 Docker
Part 1 needs Tutorial 0 and a Google Cloud project with billing; part 2 needs only Docker.

21
00:01:07,533 --> 00:01:09,338
我们是在 Linux 上录制的
We recorded on Linux,

22
00:01:09,338 --> 00:01:13,720
录制时用的是 Docker Engine 29.8.2
with Docker Engine 29.8.2 at the time of recording.

23
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:18,008
在 Mac 或 Git BASH 里，提示符和少数几条消息会不一样
On a Mac or in Git BASH, the prompt and a few messages differ;

24
00:01:18,008 --> 00:01:19,864
命令和 port 不会变
the commands and ports don't.

25
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:23,023
有一点先说清楚：我们录制时没有 Google 账号
One honest limit: we had no Google account.

26
00:01:23,343 --> 00:01:25,179
凡是代码调用 Google 的地方
Wherever the code calls Google,

27
00:01:25,179 --> 00:01:29,977
你会看到命令、缺少密钥时的真实报错，以及该看什么
you'll see the command, the real error a missing key gives, and what to look for.

28
00:01:31,017 --> 00:01:35,489
在第 3 讲里，课程给了你一个共用的 bucket 和一个共用的密钥
In lecture 3, the course handed you a shared bucket and one shared key,

29
00:01:35,489 --> 00:01:37,694
复制进了每个组件目录
copied into every component folder.

30
00:01:38,014 --> 00:01:42,494
这个分支还是同一条 pipeline，只是照真正团队的做法来搭建
This branch is the same pipeline, built the way a real team would build it.

31
00:01:42,734 --> 00:01:44,441
你们组有自己的 bucket
Your team owns its bucket.

32
00:01:44,761 --> 00:01:49,155
你要创建自己的服务账号，把它唯一的密钥放在 repo 外面
You create your own service account, and keep its one key outside the repo.

33
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,989
你不用再写 Dockerfile 了
You no longer write the Dockerfile:

34
00:01:51,989 --> 00:01:56,205
它已经和 pyproject.toml、uv.lock 一起 commit 了
it's committed, together with pyproject.toml and uv.lock.

35
00:01:56,525 --> 00:02:00,111
而且每个组件都有一个脚本，docker-shell.sh
And each component has one script, docker-shell.sh,

36
00:02:00,111 --> 00:02:04,120
里面装着那两条很长的 docker build 和 docker run 命令
that holds the long docker build and docker run commands.

37
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:08,533
五个阶段没有变，它们仍然从不互相调用
The five stages haven't changed, and they still never call each other:

38
00:02:08,533 --> 00:02:11,748
每个都写进 bucket，下一个再从里面读
each writes to the bucket, and the next reads from it.

39
00:02:12,068 --> 00:02:14,970
直接通信的 container，第二部分再讲
Containers that talk directly come in part 2.

40
00:02:15,217 --> 00:02:17,350
一个团队有两个办法拿到 image
A team can get an image two ways.

41
00:02:17,670 --> 00:02:21,638
项目早期，每个人都用 Git 里的配方自己构建
Early in a project, everyone builds it from the recipe in Git.

42
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:25,776
后来，一个人把做好的 image 发布到 Docker Hub
Later, one person publishes finished images to Docker Hub,

43
00:02:25,776 --> 00:02:27,376
其他人都直接 pull
and everyone else pulls.

44
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:29,200
仔细看这个 tag
Look closely at the tag.

45
00:02:29,349 --> 00:02:33,097
它是一个路标，指向某一个特定的 image
It's a signpost to one particular image, built on some day,

46
00:02:33,097 --> 00:02:35,131
某一天、用某个版本的配方构建出来的
from some version of the recipe.

47
00:02:35,451 --> 00:02:38,224
没有任何东西保证它和你手上的 commit 对得上
Nothing promises it matches the commit you have.

48
00:02:38,467 --> 00:02:42,648
有一个脚本决定你拿到的是哪一个；我们会一行一行地读它
One script decides which of the two you get; we'll read it line by line.

49
00:02:42,968 --> 00:02:44,317
先拿到代码
First, the code.

50
00:02:44,367 --> 00:02:45,789
从头开始？
Starting fresh?

51
00:02:45,839 --> 00:02:47,646
在你的工作区目录里
From your workspace folder,

52
00:02:47,646 --> 00:02:50,591
clone 这个 repo 并直接 checkout 到这个分支
clone the repo with this branch checked out:

53
00:02:50,591 --> 00:02:53,135
git clone，加上 --branch flexible-workflow
git clone, --branch flexible-workflow.

54
00:02:53,455 --> 00:02:55,546
然后 cd 进 mega-pipeline
Then cd into mega-pipeline.

55
00:02:55,866 --> 00:02:57,350
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

56
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,511
两个额外检查：git branch 显示
Two extra checks: git branch

57
00:02:59,511 --> 00:03:03,282
当前分支是 flexible-workflow，停在我们录制时的那个 commit
shows flexible-workflow at the commit we recorded,

58
00:03:03,282 --> 00:03:04,790
transcribe audio 里有
and transcribe audio

59
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:09,391
Dockerfile、这个脚本、pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
holds its Dockerfile, the script, pyproject.toml and uv.lock,

60
00:03:09,391 --> 00:03:11,352
都由这个分支 commit 好了
which this branch commits.

61
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,819
已经有第 3 讲的 clone 了？
Already have your clone from lecture 3?

62
00:03:14,139 --> 00:03:17,637
它在 main 上；如果你是重新 clone 的，直接跳到下一章
It's on main; if you cloned fresh, skip to the next chapter.

63
00:03:17,957 --> 00:03:19,856
第 1 步：cd 进去
Step 1: cd into it.

64
00:03:20,176 --> 00:03:22,160
两个额外检查显示它现在的状态
Two extra checks show its state.

65
00:03:22,867 --> 00:03:24,225
分成三堆
Three piles.

66
00:03:24,275 --> 00:03:26,728
你改过的 cli.py 是已跟踪的
Your edited cli.py is tracked.

67
00:03:27,048 --> 00:03:30,142
你在 generate text 里新建的两个文件是未跟踪的
Your two new files in generate text are untracked.

68
00:03:30,462 --> 00:03:32,112
在 transcribe audio 里
In transcribe audio,

69
00:03:32,112 --> 00:03:37,395
Dockerfile、pyproject.toml、uv.lock 和密钥都是被忽略的
the Dockerfile, pyproject.toml, uv.lock and the key are ignored.

70
00:03:37,634 --> 00:03:39,661
第 2 步：git fetch origin
Step 2, git fetch origin.

71
00:03:39,981 --> 00:03:41,422
在这里它什么都没打印
Here it prints nothing:

72
00:03:41,422 --> 00:03:45,399
clone 下来的 repo 本来就有所有分支，上游也没有任何变化
a clone already has every branch, and nothing had changed upstream.

73
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:47,319
你的可能会列出一些更新
Yours may list updates.

74
00:03:47,534 --> 00:03:50,226
第 3 步：git checkout flexible-workflow
Step 3, git checkout flexible-workflow,

75
00:03:50,226 --> 00:03:52,504
Git 拒绝了，原因有两个
and Git refuses, for two reasons.

76
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:55,620
你对 cli.py 的修改会被覆盖
Your edits to cli.py would be overwritten,

77
00:03:55,620 --> 00:04:00,131
而且两个未跟踪的文件正好放在这个分支自己也有文件的地方
and two untracked files sit where the branch has files of its own.

78
00:04:00,451 --> 00:04:01,817
什么都没变
Nothing changed.

79
00:04:01,867 --> 00:04:04,528
README 的提示解决的是第一个原因
The README's note covers the first reason:

80
00:04:04,528 --> 00:04:08,139
git stash 把你的修改收起来，第一堵墙倒了
git stash puts your edits away, and the first wall falls.

81
00:04:08,459 --> 00:04:11,339
再试一次，未跟踪的文件还是挡着它
On a retry, the untracked files still block it.

82
00:04:11,584 --> 00:04:14,784
一个小缺口：这条提示只管改过的文件
A small gap: the note covers only edited files.

83
00:04:15,104 --> 00:04:16,604
额外跑一个 git stash -u
An extra git stash -u

84
00:04:16,604 --> 00:04:20,181
把未跟踪的文件也 stash 起来，checkout 就成功了
stashes untracked files too, and the checkout works.

85
00:04:20,501 --> 00:04:23,159
另一个办法是 git checkout，加上 -- 和一个点
The other option, git checkout -- .,

86
00:04:23,159 --> 00:04:27,072
它丢弃你的修改，不动未跟踪的文件
discards your edits and leaves untracked files alone.

87
00:04:27,317 --> 00:04:30,752
第 5 步，git branch：星号在 flexible-workflow 上
Step 5, git branch: * flexible-workflow.

88
00:04:31,072 --> 00:04:36,054
切换你自己的 clone 之前，先把第 3 讲里想保留的 Dockerfile
Before you switch your own clone, copy out any lecture 3 Dockerfile,

89
00:04:36,054 --> 00:04:41,184
pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock 复制出来：切换会把它们替换掉
pyproject.toml and uv.lock you want to keep: the switch replaces them.

90
00:04:41,504 --> 00:04:42,884
暂停一下，切换过去
Pause and switch.

91
00:04:42,934 --> 00:04:46,792
额外检查显示，你在第 3 讲里
Extra checks show your ignored lecture 3 Dockerfile,

92
00:04:46,792 --> 00:04:50,134
那些被忽略的 Dockerfile、pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
pyproject.toml and uv.lock were replaced by the branch's,

93
00:04:50,134 --> 00:04:52,134
已经被这个分支的版本一声不吭地替换了
without a word:

94
00:04:52,134 --> 00:04:54,880
想留着的话，先把它们复制出来
copy them out first if you want them.

95
00:04:55,117 --> 00:04:58,406
旧密钥还留在 transcribe audio 里
The old key still sits inside transcribe audio;

96
00:04:58,406 --> 00:05:01,346
你的 secrets 原地不动，README 也是这么说的
your secrets stay put, as the README says.

97
00:05:01,666 --> 00:05:04,243
在那个目录里，每次构建都会把它复制进 image
Every build there copies it into the image,

98
00:05:04,243 --> 00:05:07,000
所以现在就把每个组件的 secrets 目录删掉
so delete each component's secrets folder now.

99
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,026
你的修改还在 stash 里等着
Your edits wait in the stash.

100
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:13,434
运行之前，先看 README 里的目录结构
Before you run, the README's folder layout:

101
00:05:13,434 --> 00:05:17,995
你的密钥放在 repo 旁边的 secrets 目录里，绝不放进 repo
your key lives in a secrets folder beside the repo, never inside it.

102
00:05:18,315 --> 00:05:21,643
往上退一级，回到你的工作区目录，把这个目录建好
Go up one level, to your workspace, and create that folder.

103
00:05:24,083 --> 00:05:28,118
第 2 步：每个 cli.py 都在开头附近设置三个值
Step 2: every cli.py sets three values near the top:

104
00:05:28,118 --> 00:05:31,998
你的项目 ID、你的 bucket 和你们的组名
your project ID, your bucket, and your group name.

105
00:05:32,233 --> 00:05:35,771
一个额外的 grep 显示 repo 里原本写的是什么
An extra grep shows what ships: three files are blank,

106
00:05:35,771 --> 00:05:40,591
三个文件留空，但 generate text 和 translate text 里
but generate text and translate text already hold the course's project and bucket,

107
00:05:40,591 --> 00:05:43,241
已经写着课程的项目和 bucket，还有授课老师的组名
and the instructor's group name.

108
00:05:43,483 --> 00:05:47,648
一个小疏漏：README 说如果你忘了改
A small slip: the README says an assert stops you if you forget,

109
00:05:47,648 --> 00:05:49,926
assert 会拦住你，但它只拒绝空值
but it only rejects an empty value.

110
00:05:50,246 --> 00:05:54,251
那两个文件会把你的调用发到课程的项目和 bucket
Those two files would send your calls to the course's project and bucket,

111
00:05:54,251 --> 00:05:56,390
在那边报权限错误
where they fail with permission errors.

112
00:05:56,633 --> 00:05:58,916
三个值都要设置，五个文件都要改
Set all three, in all five files.

113
00:05:59,236 --> 00:06:02,117
额外的 git diff 显示了我们的占位值
An extra git diff shows our placeholders,

114
00:06:02,117 --> 00:06:05,404
your-project-id、your-team-bucket 和 group-01
your-project-id, your-team-bucket and group-01;

115
00:06:05,404 --> 00:06:06,674
换成你自己的
type your own.

116
00:06:06,724 --> 00:06:11,566
在 translate text 里，还要把目标语言从西班牙语改成法语
In translate text, also change the target language from Spanish to French.

117
00:06:11,886 --> 00:06:13,400
暂停一下，把它们改好
Pause and edit them.

118
00:06:13,450 --> 00:06:17,798
第 3 步，你的 bucket：各个组件读写这些前缀
Step 3, your bucket: the components read and write these prefixes,

119
00:06:17,798 --> 00:06:20,895
每个输出都落在你们组名的下面
and every output lands under your group's name.

120
00:06:21,133 --> 00:06:26,048
还有一个小缺口：README 没说怎么创建 bucket
Another small gap: the README never says how to create the bucket,

121
00:06:26,048 --> 00:06:29,026
而且它的示例上传文件叫 test.mp3
and its sample upload is named test.mp3.

122
00:06:29,346 --> 00:06:31,267
在控制台里把 bucket 创建好
Create the bucket in the console.

123
00:06:31,517 --> 00:06:36,956
然后把一段短录音上传到一个叫 input audios 的目录里
Then upload a short recording into a folder named input_audios,

124
00:06:36,956 --> 00:06:38,941
文件名以 input- 开头、以 .mp3 结尾
as input-something.mp3.

125
00:06:39,261 --> 00:06:41,094
转写文本沿用这个名字
The transcript keeps that name,

126
00:06:41,094 --> 00:06:43,933
而且上传时只会发送名字以 input 开头的文件
and upload only sends names starting with input.

127
00:06:44,253 --> 00:06:46,920
bucket 的名字是全局唯一的：挑一个别人没用过的
Bucket names are global: pick a unique one.

128
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,001
暂停一下，创建你自己的 bucket
Pause and create yours.

129
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:55,708
你的 bucket 只放行能证明自己是谁、而且有权限的调用方
Your bucket only lets in callers who prove who they are and have permission.

130
00:06:56,028 --> 00:07:00,380
对代码来说，这个身份就是一个服务账号，配一个 JSON 密钥
For code, that identity is a service account, with one JSON key.

131
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:04,737
Google 的库会把这个密钥换成一个短期有效的访问令牌
Google's libraries turn that key into a short-lived token,

132
00:07:04,737 --> 00:07:08,793
每个打到 Google API 门口的调用，都必须通过三道关卡
and every call to Google's API doors must pass three gates.

133
00:07:09,033 --> 00:07:14,174
第 1 关问你是谁：没有密钥，调用在你的 container 里就失败了
Gate 1 asks who you are: without the key, the call fails inside your container.

134
00:07:14,494 --> 00:07:18,014
第 2 关问你能做什么：这个账号需要角色
Gate 2 asks what you may do: the account needs a role.

135
00:07:18,334 --> 00:07:21,257
第 3 关问这个 API 打开了没有
Gate 3 asks if the API is switched on.

136
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:26,321
在控制台里创建一个服务账号，比如叫 mega-pipeline-sa
In the console, create a service account, for example mega-pipeline-sa.

137
00:07:26,641 --> 00:07:30,926
给它授予四个角色：所有组件都要的 Storage Admin
Grant it four roles: Storage Admin for every component,

138
00:07:30,926 --> 00:07:33,342
Gemini 要的 Agent Platform User
Agent Platform User for Gemini,

139
00:07:33,342 --> 00:07:37,393
还有 Cloud Speech Client 和 Cloud Translation API User
Cloud Speech Client, and Cloud Translation API User.

140
00:07:37,633 --> 00:07:40,718
Text-to-Speech 不需要角色。一个小疏漏
Text-to-Speech needs no role. A small slip:

141
00:07:40,718 --> 00:07:44,365
generate text 的 README 还写着 Vertex AI User
the generate text README still says Vertex AI User,

142
00:07:44,365 --> 00:07:46,081
现在已经搜不到这个角色了
which finds nothing now.

143
00:07:46,317 --> 00:07:50,648
下载一个 JSON 密钥；它的文件名是一长串自动生成的字符
Download a JSON key; it arrives with a long generated name.

144
00:07:50,968 --> 00:07:53,184
把它重命名为 mega-pipeline.json
Rename it mega-pipeline.json,

145
00:07:53,184 --> 00:07:56,088
放进 repo 旁边的 secrets 目录
in the secrets folder beside the repo.

146
00:07:56,408 --> 00:07:58,951
谁拿到它，谁就能花你项目的钱
Whoever holds it can spend your project's money:

147
00:07:58,951 --> 00:08:00,823
绝不要 commit，也不要贴到任何地方
never commit or paste it.

148
00:08:01,067 --> 00:08:05,355
接下来启用 API，在控制台里或者用 gcloud 都行
Next, enable the APIs, in the console or with gcloud.

149
00:08:05,675 --> 00:08:09,387
照原样输入的话，设置项目的那条命令会失败
Typed exactly as written, the set project command fails:

150
00:08:09,387 --> 00:08:13,696
shell 把占位符两边的尖括号当成了重定向
the shell reads the placeholder's angle brackets as redirections.

151
00:08:14,016 --> 00:08:16,896
输入你自己的项目 ID，不要带尖括号
Type your own project ID, without brackets.

152
00:08:17,133 --> 00:08:19,920
